# DEMO MODE generated output — always regenerated from demo.config.js +
# the real source via `npm run build:demo`. Never hand-edit; never commit
# (if you deploy the demo as its own Netlify site, point its build command
# at `npm run build:demo` and its publish directory at `demo`, so it's
# built fresh from source on every deploy instead of going stale in git).
